    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">farrātus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
